This product is a Rust port of part of Chyp, "an interactive theorem prover
for string diagrams":

  Chyp
  Copyright (C) 2022-2023 Aleks Kissinger
  https://github.com/akissinger/chyp
  Ported from commit 3d28483 ("fixed some bugs in the docs").
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Chyp's design and algorithms (cospans of hypergraphs, convex matching,
double-pushout rewriting, the proof-checking model and the layer
decomposition used for layout) are Aleks Kissinger's. The files under src/
that carry a "Ported from Chyp" header are modified translations of the
named Chyp source files; each header lists what was changed.

The test fixtures in tests/fixtures/upstream/ are copied unmodified from
Chyp's examples/ directory at the same commit. The fixtures in
tests/fixtures/derived/ are derived from those examples, as stated at the top
of each file.

